<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Powertek 1996 net up 42.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Powertek 1996 net up 42.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  67.55   vs	  47.53</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 37.0    vs	  34.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   199.20   vs	 159.11</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   100.88   vs	  68.53</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend			-     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Powertek Bhd is engaged in power generation.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
